# Task 12: Implement RoadmapAgentService

Implement the core agent service — manages conversations, streams LLM responses, executes tools, parses roadmap output, and persists everything. Uses `IChatClient` from `Microsoft.Extensions.AI`.

## Proposed Changes

### Agent Services

#### [NEW] [FallbackChatClient.cs](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Services/FallbackChatClient.cs)

A delegating `IChatClient` that tries primary (Groq), catches retriable errors (429, 5xx, `HttpRequestException`), retries with fallback (Gemini). Does **not** fallback on 400 errors.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Streaming fallback behavior:**
> - **Primary path:** Chunks yielded directly — full real-time streaming.
> - **On mid-stream failure:** Primary chunks already flushed to the SSE connection are gone. Fallback **restarts the entire request from scratch**. Client sees: `tokens → brief silence → fresh tokens from fallback`. Output is **not** a continuation; fallback regenerates from the original messages. May produce different/repeated content — acceptable because fallback is the exception path, and buffering the primary stream for 99% of happy-path requests would kill the streaming UX.
> - `GetResponseAsync` — simple try/catch, retry with fallback.
> - `GetService` — delegates to primary.
> - **Lifetime:** Registered as `AddSingleton` — lives for app lifetime. Both inner `IChatClient` instances are stateless HTTP clients, so this is safe.

---

#### [NEW] [RoadmapAgentService.cs](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Services/RoadmapAgentService.cs)

Core agent service implementing [IRoadmapAgentService](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Interfaces/IRoadmapAgentService.cs#7-8).

**Injected dependencies:** `IChatClient`, `IWebSearchService`, [IRoadmapRepository](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Interfaces/IRoadmapRepository.cs#10-48), [IConversationRepository](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Interfaces/IConversationRepository.cs#9-47), `IUnitOfWork<ApplicationDbContext>`, `ILogger<RoadmapAgentService>`

**AgentType property:** `public AgentType AgentType => AgentType.RoadmapGenerator;`

**`StartConversationAsync(userId, initialMessage, ct)`:**
1. Create [AgentConversation](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Entities/AgentConversation.cs#10-53) (status: `Active`, agentType: `RoadmapGenerator`, title: first 100 chars)
2. Create system message (`PromptLoader.RoadmapSystemPrompt`) + user message
3. Add via [IConversationRepository](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Interfaces/IConversationRepository.cs#9-47), save via [IUnitOfWork](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Interfaces/IUnitOfWork.cs#11-34)
4. Return conversation

---

**`ProcessMessageAsync(conversationId, userMessage, userId, ct)` → `IAsyncEnumerable<AgentStreamEvent>`:**

1. Load conversation with messages → throw [NotFoundException](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Exceptions/NotFoundException.cs#6-18) if null
2. Verify `conversation.UserId == userId` → throw [ForbiddenException](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Exceptions/ForbiddenException.cs#8-12) if not
3. Add user message, save
4. Build `List<ChatMessage>` from conversation history (see mapping below)
5. Create tools: `WebSearchTool.Create(webSearchService)`

**Message Role Mapping** ([ConversationMessage](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Entities/ConversationMessage.cs#9-41) → `ChatMessage`):

| `MessageRole` | `ChatMessage` constructor |
|---|---|
| `System` | `new ChatMessage(ChatRole.System, content)` |
| `User` | `new ChatMessage(ChatRole.User, content)` |
| `Assistant` | `new ChatMessage(ChatRole.Assistant, content)` |
| [Tool](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Tools/WebSearchTool.cs#13-43) | `new ChatMessage(ChatRole.Tool, content)` |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Streaming loop — accumulate then branch:**
> `GetStreamingResponseAsync` interleaves text and tool-call chunks. The loop must:
> 1. Accumulate **both** `StringBuilder` (text) **and** tool-calls list simultaneously
> 2. Yield [("delta", chunk.Text)](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Tools/WebSearchTool.cs#15-42) for each non-null text chunk as it arrives
> 3. **Only after stream fully closes**, branch on accumulated result

6. **Agent loop** (max 10 iterations), propagating [ct](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/DTOs/Agent/PhaseProject.cs#8-30) through all async calls:
   ```
   for each iteration:
     a. stream = chatClient.GetStreamingResponseAsync(messages, options, ct)
     b. textBuffer = new StringBuilder()
        toolCalls = new List<FunctionCallContent>()
     c. await foreach (update in stream.WithCancellation(ct)):
          - if update.Text != null → textBuffer.Append; yield ("delta", update.Text)
          - collect any FunctionCallContent into toolCalls
     d. After stream closes — branch:
        - If toolCalls.Any():
            yield ("status", "Searching for resources...")
            execute each tool call
            append assistant message (with tool calls) + tool result messages
            continue loop
        - Else (text-only response):
            fullText = textBuffer.ToString()
            check for roadmap/phase JSON
            break loop
   If loop exhausts 10 iterations → yield ("error", "Max iterations reached")
   This is NOT "done" — hitting the safety limit is abnormal termination.
   ```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **JSON markers:** The system prompt uses `StartOfAnswer` / `EndOfAnswer` markers — **not** triple-backtick fences. Parse JSON by extracting text between these markers. The original task spec's mention of ` ```json ``` ` markers was inaccurate — we are intentionally overriding the spec here to match the actual [RoadmapSystemPrompt.md](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Prompts/RoadmapSystemPrompt.md) source of truth.

7. **Roadmap JSON → Entity mapping:**

```
Parsed JSON                     →  Entity
─────────────────────────────────────────────
title                           →  Roadmap.Title
topic                           →  Roadmap.Topic
description                     →  Roadmap.Description
estimatedDurationWeeks          →  Roadmap.EstimatedDurationWeeks
phases[].title                  →  RoadmapPhase.Title
phases[].description            →  RoadmapPhase.Description
phases[].order                  →  RoadmapPhase.Order
phases[].durationEstimateWeeks  →  RoadmapPhase.DurationEstimateWeeks
phases[].resources[]            →  RoadmapPhase.Resources (List<PhaseResource>)
phases[].projects[]             →  RoadmapPhase.Projects (List<PhaseProject>)
phases[].insights[]             →  RoadmapPhase.Insights (List<string>)
```

8. **Roadmap vs Phase-edit discriminator:**
   - `conversation.RoadmapId == null` → **new roadmap**. Parse full JSON, create [Roadmap](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Entities/Roadmap.cs#10-62) + [RoadmapPhase](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Core/Entities/RoadmapPhase.cs#10-62) entities, save, set `conversation.RoadmapId`, mark `Completed`, yield [("roadmap_complete", new { roadmapId })](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Tools/WebSearchTool.cs#15-42)
   - `conversation.RoadmapId != null` → **phase edit**. LLM returns single phase JSON with `"phaseId": "<guid>"`. Match strictly via `GetPhaseByIdAsync(phaseId)`, update fields, save, yield [("phase_updated", new { phaseId })](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Tools/WebSearchTool.cs#15-42)

> [!WARNING]
> **System prompt prerequisite:** [RoadmapSystemPrompt.md](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Prompts/RoadmapSystemPrompt.md) STATE 4 (EDIT) must instruct the LLM to include `"phaseId": "<guid>"` in phase-edit JSON. The service provides existing phase IDs in the conversation context when a roadmap is completed.

9. Save assistant message to conversation
10. Yield [("done")](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Tools/WebSearchTool.cs#15-42)

> [!CAUTION]
> **C# iterator error boundary:** `ProcessMessageAsync` returns `IAsyncEnumerable`, making it an async iterator. A try/catch wrapping the method body does **not** catch iteration-time exceptions — the method returns a cold enumerable immediately. The try/catch must be **inside the iterator body**, wrapping the yield statements, so exceptions during iteration are caught and converted to `yield return ("error", ex.Message)`.

