### Unit Tests

#### [NEW] [RoadmapAgentServiceTests.cs](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/tests/LetopiaPlatform.UnitTests/Agent/RoadmapAgentServiceTests.cs)

| Test | Scenario | Key Assertion |
|------|----------|---------------|
| `StartConversation_CreatesConversationAndMessages` | Normal flow | Conversation + 2 messages created |
| `ProcessMessage_TextResponse_YieldsDeltaEvents` | Mock returns plain text | `await foreach` collects `delta` + `done` |
| `ProcessMessage_ToolCall_ExecutesToolAndContinues` | Mock returns tool call then text | Tool executed, second LLM call made |
| `ProcessMessage_RoadmapJson_SavesAndYieldsComplete` | Mock returns `StartOfAnswer`…JSON…`EndOfAnswer` | `roadmap_complete`, [Add](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/DependencyInjection.cs#14-33) called |
| `ProcessMessage_PhaseEdit_UpdatesAndYieldsPhaseUpdated` | Conversation has `RoadmapId`, mock returns phase JSON with `phaseId` | `phase_updated`, `GetPhaseByIdAsync` called |
| `ProcessMessage_WrongUser_ThrowsForbidden` | userId mismatch | **Must `await foreach`** to trigger |
| `ProcessMessage_MaxIterations_YieldsError` | Mock always returns tool calls | [("error", "Max iterations reached")](file:///d:/mohamed/LetopiaPlatform/src/LetopiaPlatform.Agent/Tools/WebSearchTool.cs#15-42) at 10 |

> [!NOTE]
> All tests must consume via `await foreach` — `ProcessMessageAsync` returns a cold `IAsyncEnumerable`.

